        {
          "book": "NAM",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "He who dashes in pieces has come up against you. Keep the fortress! Watch the way! Strengthen your waist! Fortify your power mightily!",
      "ko": "파괴하는 자가 너를 치러 올라왔나니 너는 산성을 지키며 길을 파수하며 네 허리를 견고히 묶고 네 힘을 크게 굳게 할찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "40e0d23c4d83eedfa7a9bb7e42b63757eed7736d5860506d3038a91ccc17c9c7",
      "translation_text_hash": "d9c8051f3b8e6fc4320e324946f48a3d8ddec5fae163000f2f7daaa65dae1759",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
