        "verse": 7
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "NAM",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "It is decreed: she is uncovered, she is carried away; and her servants moan as with the voice of doves, beating on their breasts.",
      "ko": "정명대로 왕후가 벌거벗은 몸으로 끌려가며 그 모든 시녀가 가슴을 치며 비둘기 같이 슬피 우는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "8e18c426858b00cfc5edaa589b8ca27380cb26b4f0e948c94218e577ed978159",
      "translation_text_hash": "f02b34a0ea9217c86916642bf913b8010a494a118207b419241011710e59b243",
